<title>USA: FINOVA Capital Corp sells $100 mln notes.</title>
<headline>FINOVA Capital Corp sells $100 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from FINOVA Capital Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to sole manager Citicorp Securities Inc.</p>
<p>FINOVA Capital Corp is the principal subsidiary of the commercial finance company FINOVA Group Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER FINOVA CAPITAL CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 7.40 PCT   MATURITY 6/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.735  FIRST PAY DATE 12/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD 7.438	 PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD +65 BP     CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
